        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nick Grindé, Karel Reisz\n- Roles: film director, screenwriter, filmmaker\n- Topics: American film, British cinema, post-World War II Britain, British cinematic realism\n\nFacts:\n- Nick Grindé was born on January 12, 1893, and he was an American film director and screenwriter.\n- Karel Reisz was born on July 21, 1926, and he was a British filmmaker active in post-World War II Britain.\n- Karel Reisz was one of the pioneers of the new realist strain in British cinema during the 1950s and 1960s.\n- Karel Reisz died on November 25, 2002.\n- Nick Grindé died on June 19, 1979.",
